  "Input and Output Devices":L("Distinguish devices that send data to a computer from devices that present results.","Input devices provide data or commands. Output devices present processed information to the user.",["keyboard → input","monitor → output","speaker → output"],["Classify three devices.","Explain one difference between input and output."],"Describe an input-process-output example."),
  "Software":L("Distinguish software from hardware and identify common software types.","Software consists of instructions and programs. System software supports computer operation, while application software helps users perform tasks.",["operating system → system software","word processor → application"],["Define software.","Give one example of each type."],"Explain how software and hardware work together."),
  "Internet Safety and Cyber Ethics":L("Use the internet safely and behave responsibly online.","Cyber ethics covers responsible online behaviour, while safety includes protecting passwords, privacy and devices and avoiding suspicious links or harmful content.",["do not share passwords","respect other people's privacy"],["List two safe habits.","Explain why phishing messages are risky."],"Create a five-rule cyber-ethics code."),
  "Word Processing":L("Use word-processing tools to create a well-formatted document.","Word processors let users enter, edit, format, save and print or share documents. Formatting improves readability when used appropriately.",["bold a heading","align a paragraph"],["Create a heading and paragraph.","Use a shortcut to copy and paste text."],"Format a short report with a heading and numbered list.")
