  "Integrity":L("Apply honesty and consistency to everyday decisions.","Integrity means acting according to sound principles and being trustworthy. It includes honesty, accountability and doing what is right even without supervision.",["admitting a mistake","returning property that is not yours"],["Give one example of integrity.","Explain why trust matters."],"Describe how integrity can influence leadership."),
