  "Cultism and Drug Abuse":L("Recognise risks and prevention strategies related to harmful group pressure and drug misuse.","Cultism can involve secretive groups associated with harmful or unlawful activities. Drug misuse can damage health, learning, relationships and safety. Prevention includes informed choices, supportive relationships and seeking trusted help.",["refusing unsafe peer pressure","talking to a trusted adult about risky situations"],["Name one risk of drug misuse.","State one safe response to peer pressure."],"Create a support plan for a learner facing harmful peer pressure."),
